    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but it's not like a huge cut or anything. it's just a small puncture. i'm pretty sure i'm up to date on my shots from a few years ago so i probably don't need to go all the way to the clinic just for a tiny hole in my leg. if i just clean it really well with peroxide and maybe put some antibiotic ointment on it, isn't that basically the same thing as what a doctor would do?",
